      "name": "voice-authoring-guidance",
      "title": "Voice authoring guidance",
      "description": "Load the active voices' rules BEFORE writing, so a block is drafted in the register it will be reviewed against. The authoring half of the voice overlay; `voice-overlay-review` is the half that runs after.",
