      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns#Skill",
      "name": "ask-the-person",
      "title": "Ask the person",
      "description": "Put one question or decision to a person: the full question, context and every option written in the chat FIRST, then the same options as a tappable card. Use before every AskUserQuestion, request_decision / Decision card, button card, or any ask that hands a choice to the owner. Input is the composed question; output is the answer, or the default taken.",
