      "name": "Close the tracking issue",
      "summary": "Clean: close the open issue carrying the tracking label (the `label` input), if any, saying why the verdict is clean.",
      "description": "Clean: close the open issue carrying the tracking label (the `label` input), if any, saying why the verdict is clean. Runs only on a clean verdict — on unknown the issue is left untouched and the job fails instead, because could-not-check is never rendered as clean.",
