      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-staging-content-change-review-phases/cat-harness/globalTask/GT_RecordSignoff",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns#Task",
      "name": "Record the sign-off as a requirement-signoff attestation",
      "summary": "THE RECORD, and not relaxable: a judgement nobody wrote down is indistinguishable from one never made (`adjudication`, A_RecordEntry).",
      "description": "THE RECORD, and not relaxable: a judgement nobody wrote down is indistinguishable from one never made (`adjudication`, A_RecordEntry). Append one `requirement-signoff` record to `test/attestations/requirement-signoff/<set slug>.attestations.json` — who (kind, id, actor), at, scope (the set or one member), the outcome from the requirement-set code list, the stage it moves the set to, the reason, and the permalink to the issue comment where it was decided — and set the set's `stage` to match. Issue #2405 FR-011 / FR-012.\n\nGW_SignoffRecorded after this reads the record back, so this step cannot be skipped by completing it: a sign-off that left no attestation loops here again.",
      "bpmnType": "bpmn:GlobalScriptTask",
      "requires": [
        "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-staging-content-change-review-phases/cat-harness/skill/adjudication"
