            "description": "A site being built: write the pages at their declared route under it instead of under the harness's own site directory. A repository's own site build passes it (the tools layer's `visualiser-writers.ts`), since its harness docs are a pinned mount.",
            "required": false,
            "arg": {
              "flag": "--site"
            }
          }
        ],
