      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns#GraphTypology",
      "name": "code",
      "renderable": false,
      "summary": "Source code -- the modules, scripts and entry points an instance holds. Declared so that code is scannable at all: an undeclared file is one no checker has a reason to look at. Being declared here says nothing about whether a Tool node claims it, which is a separate question and a separate axis.",
      "validatorNotApplicable": "its nodes are TypeScript — 1793 files, counted 2026-09-24. `tsc` is the validator for code, and `check:partition` plus `check-code-accounting` grade the graph over it."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/v0/ns#graphTypology/test-plan",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/ns#GraphTypology",
      "name": "test-plan",
      "renderable": false,
      "summary": "Test plans -- one `test-plan/v1` document per plan, in the FHIR R5 TestPlan shape: the system-under-test kind and version range, the `req:` requirements it is evidence for, test cases whose assertions are criterion ids, fixed (reviewed) or generated (template + params + seed) test data, and the certification rule as a DMN reference.",
      "validator": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-staging-content-change-review-phases/cat-harness/schema/test-plan"
    },
