      "description": "Test plans this instance certifies against — one `test-plan/v1` document per plan (`schemas/sdlc/test-plan.ts`). Content, not state: a process reads a plan and never writes it, and the run points at the plan, never the reverse. The runs and reports a plan's execution produces go to the `qa-reports` branch with the rest of `test/results/`, and the certification decision to `test/attestations/` (owner ruling D2). First declared for dogfood plan #1, `crdm-detect-evaluation` (bean `folio-assistant-ff09`). Declared WITH its files, per bean dh4f.",
      "readmePath": "test/plans/README.md",
